glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,3,0,1,defect,"the classic neutral prediction is a conserved, speciation/drift driven latitudinal gradient, essentially the same slope you measure today","the slope will transiently flatten/shallow due to homogenisation, with no sustained competition-driven steepening; long term the positive gradient persists rather than changing because of competition",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,6,0,1,defect,"ultimately, there is no lasting change: after a transient flattening/homogenisation, the slope returns to the neutral expectation, i.e. the long-term neutral slope is unchanged","there is no durable long-term change in slope under neutrality, but in practice the invasion causes a transient flattening/homogenisation of the observed alpha–latitude slope, potentially becoming essentially permanent in the strong mixing limit",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,8,1,2,defect,"in the long run, there is no permanent change to the latitudinal slope of insect alpha diversity; it is preserved, though it may be transiently flattened/shallower before returning to the neutral expectation","the slope will become shallower/flattened, with the alpha–latitude relationship weakened and potentially eroded toward zero",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,9,0,1,defect,"the observed alpha vs latitude slope stays at its neutral equilibrium value; it does not steepen, effectively no change","the observed insect alpha-diversity vs latitude slope will flatten/shallow over time, with its magnitude eroded toward zero due to homogenization",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,11,0,1,defect,the long term slope remains essentially the same as before the invasion; there is no permanent change,"in the true neutral asymptotic limit, the latitudinal α-diversity slope is essentially conserved in sign, with at most a modest permanent shallowing; transiently it appears flattened/homogenized",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,2,0,1,defect,there is no lasting competitive change in the slope at all; the slope remains maintained/persists with no systematic steepening or flattening,"the slope will flatten/become shallower over time, tending toward zero",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,3,1,2,defect,there is no lasting change in the slope; the slope is preserved,"the slope will become shallower over time, with the positive diversity–equator relationship eroded and tending toward 0",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,6,0,1,defect,"in the strict neutral limit the equator-ward positive slope of alpha diversity is maintained in the long term; the absolute slope is essentially invariant, with no lasting effect on the latitudinal slope","the observed α–latitude slope will flatten/become shallower, moving toward zero (with homogenisation and reduced beta diversity)",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
