glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,11,0,1,defect,the slope of α-diversity with proximity to the equator is essentially unchanged,"the latitudinal diversity slope is eroded/flattened, tending toward 0",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,12,0,1,defect,"in the strict neutral limit, the latitudinal slope of alpha diversity is recovered and remains essentially the same as before the introduction, with only stochastic fluctuations around it","the slope will flatten and become shallower, with reduced magnitude; in the infinite-dispersal limit it tends to zero",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,2,1,2,defect,"no change in the slope; the equator-to-pole alpha diversity gradient is maintained, with at most a parallel upward shift","the slope is preserved with no systematic change, at most a parallel upward shift, though the response also mentions a very slight attenuation as a second-order effect",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
