glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66fe796b_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66fe796bc12cbe6aeaa26e69,3/4,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,3,0,1,defect,infinite regress and circularity,"the two problems identified are: (1) justified false belief has no distinct place and collapses into mere belief, and (2) unjustified true belief has no distinct place and also collapses into mere belief",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66fe796b_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66fe796bc12cbe6aeaa26e69,3/4,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,9,0,1,defect,circularity and a regress (infinite regress),"the two problems are the ""justified false belief"" gap and the ""unjustified true belief"" gap: jtb cannot track justification independently of truth or truth independently of justification, so belief becomes a catch-all for justified false belief, unjustified true belief, and unjustified false belief",0,exactMatch,idiosyncratic_veer,0
